  "description": "CRC and 8-bit checksum calculation, frame encoding, error detection and payload decoding for byte sequences through a common ErrorDetection API.\nSupports CRC8 Classic/Maxim, CRC16 Classic/Modbus/CCITT XModem/DNP, CRC32 Classic, and XOR/NMEA, modulo-256 and two's-complement checksums.\nTargets .NET Standard 2.1. See the package README for examples and byte-order behavior.",
