  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1\n- Make CRC16 and CRC32 lookup-table initialization safe during concurrent first use.\n- Reduce repeated enumeration, redundant frame-length checks and CRC8/CRC16 byte-array traversal overhead.\n- Remove boxing, marshaling and temporary serialization buffers from CRC16/CRC32 digest packing.\n- Preserve the public API, existing calculation results, native byte order and legacy DNP representation.\n- Add independent correctness, compatibility and initialization tests, Windows/Linux Debug/Release CI, and corrected executable README examples.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/blob/master/Mythosia.Integrity/RELEASE_NOTES.md",
